These files are emitted by the OpenSpec CLI's project initialization
(`openspec init --tools claude`). Their front matter records the generating
version — the packaged copies were generated by OpenSpec `1.6.0` and declare
`license: MIT` with `metadata.author: openspec`. Zimaflow packages them
unmodified so that a Zimaflow distribution can route to the canonical OpenSpec
workflow; Zimaflow claims no authorship of them.

OpenSpec itself is an external dependency. Zimaflow does not vendor, install,
or update the OpenSpec CLI; see
`references/Codex-Packaging-External-Dependencies.md`.

